  "description": {
    "text": "The First Partner Collector's Binder came out on 26 February 2021, at the start of the Pokémon 25th Anniversary year, to hold the jumbo cards of the First Partner Packs that followed through the year. It came with one jumbo card of its own, which the packs did not have: Base Set's yellow-cheeked Pikachu, enlarged, without the Wizards of the Coast copyright and with a foil 25th Anniversary logo in the corner of the artwork. Some retailers sold it with three booster packs.",
